ulator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, September to October and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 58% of normal in September to October and 50% in November to December. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, and grid 16075 got down to 49% that year.</p>"}
